        <section id="release-notes"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Release notes
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>Release notes are a good way of software companies communicating with customers about improvements and new features. A release note refers to the technical documentation which accompanies a new software release or update and communicates information on recent changes, feature enhancements or bug fixes or describes a new product.</p>
<p>The primary target for release notes is the product user, but they can also be used internally within a company.</p>
<p>Release notes can be distributed through a range of channels such as email, app stores, blog posts, social media or in app messaging.</p>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/uc/uc_u5_s1_p4_image.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
